  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcbb880135ff5b65b68b1f9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能深深体会到因为遇见了许多人……\\n才能走到这一步的感触，\\n是很棒的歌词呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24dea34e60169812215c461951e8efc57cb581c7a30ebcf5cc86ca904d83caef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "143"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/143"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:047afbf5f3243ac71857aefc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入这所学园至今的每一天和\\n之后的每一天……是一首\\n赋予两方希望的美妙歌曲呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f2e7706af5ff1b50cb37091b03b9719be0963b2b23ec6258cbd1f5f765e8d9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "144"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/144"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3210712db91f6e689f54b893",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想说下次去卡拉OK要唱这首！\\n那就快来发LANE\\n邀素质、生野和涡轮……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa3b95e7ef873c8f5aa8bb3defe3d51b33731d6282df26bc48fa9811a466820",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "145"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/145"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dc67a5072db186373af6ccb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "记得有在丸善斯基爱车的\\n副驾驶席上听过……是首会让人想到\\n英姿潇洒的赛马娘在奔驰的好歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b4774ff1815b3d94f5a0947b0710c2b8930f43e2214c7475301019bedbfa73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "146"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/146"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3aa52344065b63f24eb4339",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我跟飞鹰子和小妙\\n去卡拉OK时有唱过喔～\\n她们还教我这首歌的舞步要怎么跳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "023ef4e27285380b53a27d5761c1f35bd282d6170fc254d5eab028a805854362",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "147"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/147"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b03485af9bf47c4d943fad58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有好多听起来很愉快的歌呢！\\n每首都棒到让人不晓得要点哪一首♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5205e6780eddcad690d24624ed2e1d17dfb6801b8e250365a2a5a772e333f5ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "148"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/148"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e5543eaeb4d3fb201939c58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拉、噜，拉～噜～♪\\n……哎呀，拍子慢了吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "79d5250017e3e2f1b5f288e088b3eb51f823f413f0ac46bf8327d58da740be20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "149"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/149"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4679cb1e098be65d7d660c03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你喜欢怎样的歌曲？\\n还希望你务必能告诉我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e406107fbda6f107d72ab44dec10e887fadb36cd6554fa3df86d11ae90aa229",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "15"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/15"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f7eefdff043bf0490f8c116",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要开始啰～！如果飞鹰子逃跑的话～？\\n预备……「只能努力追──上去！」\\n欸嘿♪谢谢大家的热情声援──☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f40777f75013ef544f3171887c4dbc1a34e83e5f0631366eef89eb7d36d40bd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "150"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/150"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d21bc79b6a1c572a427105",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇～都是些很好听的歌耶！\\n如果训练员不介意的话，\\n请把你推荐的歌告诉我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb4831bb99cdd4b54736e64e4a62618f26ff4c10d93d01e9bd48c5c93e0b535f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "151"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/151"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2116b76911a14b4028123d05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂！不准逃，给我听这个。\\n因为我要让你的耳膜也染上\\n阿船的音色……☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d5a4d67b7cdc954ee9e114e6a11695842c5972367cc94025c974cc12a568e1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "152"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/152"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14bf99095342fb7454cd0bd3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "都是些听了会令人\\n心情雀跃的歌呢。训练员喜欢\\n什么样的歌曲呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3b2415793ae322ce8c9b51663dbfba5e27d616e1e363f3430df8c00eb3e9ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "153"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/153"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00457c8dd73fe4e66ebb8149",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要一边听着音乐，感觉就能\\n持续不断地跑下去！\\n你跑步时会想听什么样的歌？",
      "source_fingerprint": "332d723da92b5a913cc31db73e6ddc2d57a97aa1b28055fc901593ca9e3ac41d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "154"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/154"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbeca73ba4db612aca5b5464",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喔！曲子选得不错呢。\\n你这不是还挺有品味的吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "800e132793ca83fec3b3c429cbd0ba378b9244bc9225ec506377f11e867c693b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "155"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/155"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3254aa24667fcde5392b24ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就拜托你来一首会让人想\\n舞动起来的活泼歌曲啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33eb8593346d89c9a1f1d3b888ba4a4c524803ea1b5e369866142de99418d481",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "156"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/156"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38f405a7ddb26b1fb7eeb0f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哦～这首歌不错耶！感觉光是听着，\\n就能想出很厉害的魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccd03e1e74b935456c30cbabca6bed6c86bb55d50b91ac7f7ab2db01b3f2733e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "157"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/157"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:177c881afac09e1c1f28baa5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我……是不讨厌音乐啦。\\n因为可以排除噪音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82462c6d41b2e8c80e61958903bf9ebd61cb7d172fa010dd05949d0435872105",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "158"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/158"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59308d0d28d1aae929825b22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每次听歌的时候，\\n就会想起和劲敌们之间的回忆喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1a7a30c746727d2d26881018fca2c6b61145cfada3ba6a2765b1959000176f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "159"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/159"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ef0a5def1013e5058ee7af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独自跳舞的时候，\\n会感到心潮澎湃……\\n我很喜欢……那样的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71ed69634970a8512ba84565618329a46d3a04ff5468ee3b5a7e74c366015e1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "16"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/16"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b77c903903a4b57ab8bdbe33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "热血到能让雪融化的演唱会，\\n在为长冬划上句号的比赛后欣赏\\n真的很合适呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5909c2f4b3762f517ec58b5c88329edfa74799b0efb87d17ad1c45f56644af2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "160"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/160"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57579464f021fcacbcb462b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这首歌的曲风又成熟又帅气……\\n为了以后跟大姐姐们一起跳舞时\\n不会出差错，我要好好练习才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fbc115c12ac84d1a7e5da025d9d05f7193941e8228bd55250efc65f40406dfd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "161"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/161"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d846c69763492e3242f2d527",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我定会以飞矢之势迅速狂奔，\\n射中胜利的红心……！\\n到那时我将献上全心全意的舞蹈！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d9208cac26dc95301dc269050d6c9c61f6bb6c8df82c3f0aa1aa67db94bfb21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "162"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/162"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0339217c2a5f5ce61e47e98a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就算跑完比赛已经精疲力尽了，\\n但因为这首歌对我来说很特别……\\n所以我一定会做到完美演出！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c1c4a8921703cf7b6983838cde43a0ed5f6bb20f28bee61523d5e510f17e35d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "163"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/163"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0e5469409bbfce378adca00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果我是这首歌的C位……\\n呵呵，大家一定都会非常惊讶吧？\\n对了！就像所谓的「嗨到爆」吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c53eb27dfbcc7d9060e6e70f7c303bc9b7317f90bf6f9d1358b63b30b595acf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "164"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/164"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dbec69c0ca9d622145bb20c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听了这首歌，就会想再体验一次\\n那么热血的对决……\\n我来去约那些家伙看看好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03122aadefa16f692056e24887751627610749eca0a1ed6bac80efd9d0c105ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "165"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/165"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e696a0f8fba9a3eee1db85a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当劲敌在自己前面的时候，\\n确实让人有种绝──对要追过她！！\\n的冲动，魔力也会跟着提升喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "beb622b8b89749955f75fb45f819d3d3b95633e341316dd8faead3e938b7bdbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "166"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/166"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca9e952f0c0bca0e0729d18a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "搜集数据跟实测模拟……\\n为了「让宿命站到我这边来」，\\n我会不惜一切努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c31d47f53a3de14197535a034e73aa695be262d9ab4a36b52922b054b3be854",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "167"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/167"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:209ce95bf1290dfc77df9f47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到这首歌的时候，\\n心情就像是点燃引擎一样……\\n会好想要立刻去跑步喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "912379d44d2ad5052622732752e38d6e7d9a71000335bcdfc9856d083bf2956d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "168"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/168"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d89e2f7d19d349f8726d338",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就像这首歌说的，unlucky时\\n也要勇敢面对绝不放弃！\\n最后一定能迎来happy的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e67894f63c331c9b6d3a3291717cbd436457ee137d1b01c9d12bf4b3b559270",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "169"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/169"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b90920f0cd6655ef7a84765",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超越极限的未来……\\n会有什么在前方等着呢……\\n我很期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "350acf2eb822ffcdd9154b02d1015627ec4c06ea358bff21bd357734f3f0d61e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "17"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/17"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20988a43448c79c51592305d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那天我所感受到的「某种感觉」……\\n如果训练员也对我有同样的感觉，\\n我会很开心的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba385bcb9cffa3ecb2a54c376abf8faedfc10e26f162ea129b1a59d57497f718",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "170"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/170"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a28f8dc3c1dc2c645999665",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是时髦的歌曲呢～♪\\n要不要边听边打扫呢？\\n感觉房间也会很开心的吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20023606da988b28abb738c4110dcf89497c7a3cbc8fcb62e1a9b1fea6e19feb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "171"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/171"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20a22260be6a7016d5d9f296",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这首歌的歌词，是大家互相讨论\\n完成的喔！耶嘿嘿，\\n你猜得到哪一段是谁写的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7badc4c8724a48b847bb96fec7dcb2180f8cdf7990d83edb92b088b5a6242b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "172"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/172"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dbece78601d23488dd7fde9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "努力、辛劳、勤奋，\\n每一样都非常闪亮又甜美☆\\n今天也会好好加油的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e6b6f398cdd9f96c5fb8a1e2aae52c926c4c199222308e78b83a8be18f83456",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "173"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/173"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b75d09060ea2cda9a9a0460f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随着时段的不同，能提升运气的歌\\n也会不一样喔！很有趣吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "89ace7d6f6a95ffb95528d0635128d0d1739e37efd0e488400363063e8996c9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "174"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/174"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abece1c7f5e36a7e11b1a114",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是时髦的曲风呢……！\\n希望我也可以赶快变成适合这首歌的\\n「都市女孩」～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "071aea0ad2100e17da7ae586b9041ee64c3c58522fa0310d74f18d6c7d1ef22f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "175"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/175"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a10820e8da36fb7afea72dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是very very nice song呢～！\\n不知道适合配上什么样的舞步？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfcf20d889bdd717d4639c91e54a675ea6fd8367515b0986d2b1e0ca63b3dc62",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "176"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/176"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861be8bb58d290ccc2eb846d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喔喔，心电感应。\\n你竟然刚好挑了\\n小真想听的歌呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a11939d8beb03b5e98e764eecbe9b09896665222e25d16bc9b229da7f935bd65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "177"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/177"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf1c15cfe831a01ae7d19d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哼、哼哼、哼……♪\\n就像小鸟拍动翅膀的微风般\\n轻快的曲调呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "848dcc7a13263e397ce3c1d0998c8def416590ccc2107cff7adce61a16625d8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "178"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/178"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65206ab3e5f28dacf2ac446f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你喜欢这首歌啊？\\n很感动人心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcee74e0dbc16b5f9858babe0bd4b4cd4cc8017e988c00004451e665d49b23c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "179"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/179"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d49d605e403b9af56dc5a260",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔唔……烦恼过头，\\n害我肚子都饿起来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcbf661b9fc1ab86308a0a796c13f0e4cf0faf902b3c5fa82aa9f64e9a3b8322",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "18"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/18"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e7d861cfec65fecea0e9836",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，有好多首歌呢。\\n我对流行总是很迟钝……\\n你能推荐给我几首吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fdfb4b9e80407f30be29c872ac854baa452e9c06e652ecdbde23124722b4e5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "180"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/180"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d500dfd9f9b8416411abc75e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "众多歌曲所演奏出的故事……\\n训练员，\\n你要不要也试着倾听呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8542f8668dd6143dd3179883d9ec974e4d5d9afcd056073776638df532d8d842",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "181"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/181"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f343045fe46b59304f2f270",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "任何旋律我都能即兴\\n改成推广苫小牧的歌词……\\n这就是我的特技喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac555083e7cfc315b54678e065035f151a423c5ff3507938fc519a14339c489d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "182"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/182"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f42ed05a3c729a503d01bd73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "DJ小阳阳！来秀一波吧，\\n手都举起来了吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "612d74619d8f199a576f41dfcd39b5d8027718a0e0ead87e4bf1ea6c27312df3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "183"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/183"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d6134a3c07dbd687fef430",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只能往前冲刺喔耶────！\\n好想再跟大小姐她们热唱一波，\\n一起度过超high的时光～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b032ec633423db8ec72ddcdd6206c83d74d4f84a639e08c7a86db4fcfd788cae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "184"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/184"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaf534a5029d6e2346ea742a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "祈求能够「抵达」──心怀前往\\n自身目标的意志与觉悟，\\n才能踏出毫不动摇的步伐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4dc9d8e4cf187cfaef2c3e8fb95a7c682a5cf995dda7e9acde712312239aa6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "185"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/185"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b1a36764b8702baa30eb9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一緒に歌うと、みんなの声がおれに\\n光をくれるんだ。…ずっと先に続く\\n未来を照らしてくれる、そんな光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa3fbd727349785e3634aaf7fcca96084ce7d9b90b525ca187b7bad1eb1d0c8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "186"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/186"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70ce96865b4326387ece3a4f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个音色，对我而言很特别。就像在\\n我心中呼啸而过后，留下了久久不散\\n的余韵般……是很重要的一首歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7904a02835e82f0cf91a4138f421c0e122c5587b85c2cf27bac1a9440fc639b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "187"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/187"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4caf40bfa6e69678a713fb61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你要挑一首适合伟大风风的\\n超～帅气的歌喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73282bfbe829f4672e19f4f84435cb5d642260fd8ff4dd7e68ba0850eec68382",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "188"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/188"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f41b94a81267cb17a490586",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喔，是这首歌啊。\\n嗯，即便现在听也很有共鸣呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "897d9ac7585c61a3738ab064ad0461ac2d5df7715c592e179ef8b62805eaa0b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "189"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/189"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641b769299d8d987865a251f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一听到这首歌啊，\\n就忍不住会想起那句谚语。\\n就是那句「有二不见得有三」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01c33847aef370f4da3ff4045e34647daad8d00a56ac8b46f1523535c827851b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "19"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/19"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a381b145b735d6cb6e63759",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可以让人把涡轮全开的歌最棒了！\\n用超大音量来播吧！超大音量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0753d1d36fedf59f17fee4f7372dd445c268d28b615952884d62f7c2cb7d1287",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "190"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/190"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f0e7a3b0696ce37508d9b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好有「都市女孩」风格的歌呀。\\n真令人憧憬……总有一天我要变得\\n配得上这首歌，闪亮亮地唱出来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b8fc819db50509fe5c604e605e35f4b7715e8c90382bf70873d4c0a23092da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "191"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/191"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca42f17ae1028c80ac678a83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我因为dance break而热血沸腾，\\n侧翻到舞台边幕的那天……\\n观众们都被我逗得超excited！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a77805d7474451a740552218fd58139207ac2a040cdc02b586616b17a4179e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "192"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/192"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b90457210d48b984cd9e55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了理解歌曲的世界观，\\n小真面对了自己的本能……\\n感受力更丰富了。Let's exercise。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96a636d3eb88ab12787b00bd73a24a1d11ee4fd8a1faad55708c3cd411f23eef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "193"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/193"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46f1d6fd55aaf327de00aae0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在赛场上奔驰的烈风，\\n这次伴随着乐音吹拂……\\n那是为了分享最快速的喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b22b2e55abfedbb0d3042585110b770e56df510091618afa4a6d94e5470c49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "194"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/194"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:330977506b97074490c11086",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有个动作是对观众比出小指对吧？\\n我要故意对兴致低迷的观众比……\\n如果对方举手响应……就是我赢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1927db32e443d189bb2ac9088d7f6c2552e90e32ea55e1a13426f3105a6e922",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "195"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/195"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53b0fbfd00fc856eee3f32f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最近的歌曲，都又快又难呢。\\n不过，这是我想好好演唱的歌。\\n我也得进化才行呢……加油～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "299d73b0adc02211c095a01894d9929c69b7fd42905d15a8aa5ca1864d97c44b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "196"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/196"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e2bb88bbaea881aa66437a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就像成为英雄传奇的主角一样……\\n率真又强烈的歌词和旋律。\\n……这首歌激发了我的勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5decb2cad173031968c70262dcea4ff18f2af78cfbe93fc1c68c5e6726e8ee59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "197"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/197"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81496bd8050e9d8e87b42e43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，你就是目击证人。\\n要见证苫小牧今后的跃进……！\\n好，今天的宣传也加油呗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcab45d847c2b3f857b2d3cd06292e6f0d620d76d48bab8e067be3da28d8aaf5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "198"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/198"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eececf4da62c325806a2fc7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个声音真的很刺激本能耶～！\\n让人想要超越最快，变得更快！所以\\n倍速爆快模式来啰☆Here we go♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "372699436d55bd466fd5d4d342744d6b6bc795679026524f1e522a7d475f50ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "199"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/199"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dee25f25853268dfe77dd177",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实，这首好像是\\n妈妈最喜欢的歌曲！看到我唱的时候\\n是她哭得最厉害的一次……欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50c75f7bebbde2fab869024734ddad0080b57b7a107cc58c72e976995868f074",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "2"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/2"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b57855b52d196ae6a922db1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "录这首歌的时候，因为赤骥和\\n伏特加吵了起来所以很辛苦。\\n真是的，幸好有带鱼网。",
      "source_fingerprint": "192d3f2a875de21a006c35acb781a0bb98c957583b09145f7d9f3c47315a410d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "20"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/20"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb087147e635cc3024e04ef6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "「烙下印记吧」……不～对！\\n被咬住不放才更难忘啦！！\\n你只准看着风风喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4ba5063ece26ecc00e4a121890abb16cf16d7433a3093ab7ecafb2ab761ec7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "200"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/200"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8863b0a4dcf943dbdcd791d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我没打算停下脚步喔。\\n因为自由的景色是没有尽头的。\\n我要继续跑下去……你打算怎么做？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54a451504c6cbe6e5f69e83f7f3cdca7d153b888afb2a987404d4fc3134de78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "201"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/201"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5116339bdb8167172d8b4da4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘哟♪赛马娘哟♪\\n训练员也一起跳～！\\n赛马娘蹦♪赛马娘跳♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1784fa95e2feff53230d00a045b4233a16cc2b63973389d85f5ccf021bf3e0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "202"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/202"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7789fc33e45b53d63439f2f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在派对上放这首歌的话，\\n就会有Lucky☆又兴奋的幸福感，\\n那天会变成最棒的一天喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bc71998826dcb508595b0aa57250498a8b6b7a80b18cb364f8192605cb83034",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "203"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/203"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dae9370ded7d4e734305481",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "叮当、叮当、叮当……♪\\n哎呀，身体自然地跟着摇摆……\\n呵呵，你也露出了很棒的笑容喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6714a2674707aa819065bf3e8c4209d538b9f782f5311afa6d4506db9db07d29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "204"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/204"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faefd3f8cf96312189d776a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想不到会由我们来唱圣诞歌！如果能\\n散发光芒掳获合家大小的心……\\n我提议表演TOMAKOMAGIC！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a52dca648fc363227cee4ff98304cf2c5b4217c42577178cfa1eb413dbc7ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "205"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/205"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8da571520d8ef6044c0fcc9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超越时代的心愿……身为受托者，\\n我的决心更加坚定了。\\n为了不忘记，我会时时哼唱……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b0a3163a0d272b5fad4a10828571959c8e8304b3ab781bc38e4ff35d1f16a39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "206"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/206"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad9e507d7c1dbddde1ce33d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Everlasting…歴史とは想いの\\n連鎖で繋がるもの。どんな逆境が\\n訪れようと、私も成してみせるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7ebd314f3eada9fc64f3e77bf88b64c5a81dbb5b416131f0df39b42adc5cf16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "207"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/207"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a4f1d63b173cdfaa283a7d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我听着这首歌沿河岸散步，\\n不知不觉就走到海边了。\\n这首歌很适合在白天散步时听呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f752ff09dd21d683fa108a9c9d0018750dbb6e562d524203067b8e015083ce99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "208"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/208"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d87527c47d70f143568b25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "涡轮要做MV的话……就要用荧光绿！\\n还要塞满闪亮的特效！\\n描绘在各种世界里旅行的涡轮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9ba629da9edb3f1b761d9bb752534736bbbf9b0c91dfd22ca46f5357d305710",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "209"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/209"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc424909f2c455c0ba04d24e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为要把比目鱼和鲽鱼当棋子用来\\n下黑白棋，所以BGM就拜托你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6765b3b9af82a1b13bfa29976f37f15b75a8853a2b65933a0d291508d4dd1958",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "21"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/21"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:927c72a73c5403d6f85ef685",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在奔跑时的心情，就如同这首\\n歌词中所写的……想要响应期待时，\\n就会成为我努力的动力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "755f84fe001398bf32d141d70126b71e8febc15d1b559d1aa18b6de5bff9f3c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "210"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/210"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5007cf496a49095f4ac72182",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在舞蹈练习时，\\n会配合种类广泛的歌曲练习。\\n我已经习惯这种曲风了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de35b6c792ecd9855beca7c2093bb46c03a382822eac6adf3761f17afe8dfef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d25b1f2595b55733ea2d8eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我──并不讨厌音乐。\\n但──也并不是很了解。\\n你喜欢的歌曲是──哪一首？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ce8fef16cfad0af74fe9e3b6da28f7e2de6efffa4ca1c73256babb2e86532f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "212"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/212"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6292bffc340cad6301afe9dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就算是沮丧的时候，\\n只要听最喜欢的歌就能得到激励！\\n请告诉我你喜欢的歌曲吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f56e088485d04b4322f7af3538a9799eac13f30871ee81b41c53821d1104e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "213"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/213"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18e820fe31f6be164aef2537",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "频率传达到了「内心的波纹」……\\n也就是「STRC」、「通讯」呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78c0e1ece0e5b2ca751d3af3882be1247c42d4a814a86937680e75294153fb15",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
